    "dc.description.abstract" : [ {
      "value" : "Summary of The Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023\nScope and Application\n•\tApplies to digital personal data in India and for Indians abroad.\n•\tExemptions for personal use, publicly available data, and legal requirements.\nKey Roles\n•\tData Principal: The individual.\n•\tData Fiduciary: Controls data processing.\n•\tData Processor: Acts on behalf of the Fiduciary.\nFiduciary Duties\n•\tLegitimate Processing: Consent or lawful uses.\n•\tTransparent Notice: Informing principals.\n•\tSecure Processing: Implementing safeguards.\nPrincipal's Rights\n•\tAccess and Transparency\n•\tCorrection and Deletion\n•\tGrievance Mechanism\nGovernance\n•\tData Protection Board: Oversight.\n•\tTribunal: Appeals.\n•\t(Penalties and Detailed Governance: Refer Full Act)\nAction Consult the full Act for detailed penalties, exemptions, and governance.",
      "language" : null,
      "authority" : null,
      "confidence" : -1,
      "place" : 0
    } ],
